+
+/**
+ * @fileoverview 'settings-lumo-hub-page' is the Lumo hub settings
+ * page (Lumo patch 0047): the single "Lumo" entry in the settings
+ * menu, right below About. It links to the Lumo Monitor page
+ * (patch 0022, which no longer has a menu item of its own) and to
+ * the Lumo font page (patch 0047).
+ */
